Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}骑兵连，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.22,0:00:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}进攻！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.27,0:00:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这一炮，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}是打给平安县城的。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}我在《虫潮围城》里新做了一个抗战战役模式\N，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}把亮剑里几个名场面，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}改编成了真能玩的关卡。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.59,0:00:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}入口就在主菜单，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.30,0:00:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}叫「抗战战役 · 亮剑名场面」。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.50,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}一共三章：李家坡的交通壕突击、骑兵连的冲\N锋突围，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}还有平安县城的开炮。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}你扮演李云龙，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.80,0:00:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}队友是张大彪、孙德胜这些独立团的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.05,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}第一章是步兵战。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.93,0:00:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}沿着交通壕往北推进，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}一路上都是日军步兵。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.14,0:00:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这里有四把制式武器：汉阳造、驳壳枪、捷克\N式轻机枪，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}还有三八式。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}距离远我就用三八式点名，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}冲近了切捷克式扫，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.94,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}弹匣二十发，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.28,0:00:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}压得住。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}推进到坡下，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.04,0:00:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}前面有两座机枪堡垒，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:00:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}各二百五的血。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这里有个坑：手雷是有抛物线的，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.17,0:01:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}站太近反而会从堡垒头顶飞过去。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}得退到十六米开外再扔，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.57,0:01:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}两发一个，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.59,0:01:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}炸得干干净净。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.49,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}堡垒端掉，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.59,0:01:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}就向坡顶的指挥阵地总攻。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.25,0:01:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}守住阵地几秒钟，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.01,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}第一章拿下。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.51,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}要是你顺手觉得这段打得还行，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.47,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}点个赞我接着往下做。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.69,0:01:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}第二章直接换玩法——骑兵。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}走过去按 I 上马，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.11,0:01:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}步枪收起、军刀出鞘，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.41,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}孙德胜带着骑兵连就在旁边集结。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.92,0:01:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}然后就是冲锋。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.47,0:01:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}按 K 冲刺，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}马速一下子拉满，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.37,0:01:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}撞上去直接一百四的伤害，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.40,0:01:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}再补一刀。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这一关要在封锁线上砍翻至少六个，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.98,0:01:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}冲到坡后面才算突破。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.20,0:01:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}骑兵连，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.20,0:01:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}进攻！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.52,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}冲开缺口还没完，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.26,0:01:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}后面有辆运输车要撤离。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.55,0:01:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}你得守在车旁边清敌兵——敌人贴到车九米内\N，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.07,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}车就开始掉血；
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.51,0:02:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}把它清干净，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.63,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}车才会往前开。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.61,0:02:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}一路护送到撤离点，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.47,0:02:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这章才算真过。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}第三章，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.42,0:02:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}平安县城。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}先在城外把机枪阵地和街道堡垒打下来，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}跟第一章一样，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.48,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}手雷拉开距离扔。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.55,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}接着是这章最有意思的部分——搬炮弹。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.87,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}走到弹药箱按 I 把炮弹扛上，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}人物会慢下来，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}再送到攻城炮那儿交付。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}然后上炮位。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.51,0:02:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}转炮口、调仰角，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.51,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}屏幕上有个预计落点环，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.53,0:02:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}对准城门它会变红、显示「城门命中」。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.03,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}开炮！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}城门七百五的血，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.76,0:02:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}一发两百七，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.05,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}三发轰开。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}李云龙那句「城门打开了，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.61,0:02:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}全团跟我进城」，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.13,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}就是这么来的。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.72,0:02:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}城门一破，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}就带队冲进县城打巷战，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}把守备队部夺下来，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.86,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}整个战役通关。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.72,0:03:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}这一版抗战战役用 Codex 开发，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.77,0:03:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}已经能在网页上玩，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.23,0:03:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}电脑手机都行，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.52,0:03:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}入口在视频简介。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.42,0:03:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}三章都是独立存档、随时能重玩。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}你更想先玩骑兵冲锋，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.33,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}还是先开那门炮？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.93,0:03:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}也可以去简介里的自研游戏投票页，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,790)}告诉我下期想看什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.50,Label,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,160)}平安县城 · 攻城炮破门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:08.70,Label,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,160)}骑兵连 · 冲锋突围
